// The code the browser entry (index.tsx) reaches, checked as its own composite project; the
// server, test and tooling projects read its declarations instead of re-checking it.
// `files` and `exclude` are generated by `node test/tsconfigProjects.mjs --write` (the test-side
// patterns live there as TEST_SIDE); test/tsconfigProjects.test.ts fails when they drift, e.g. a
// TS6307 after the app starts importing a server file or a new file outside pmo-portal.
// `npm run typecheck` runs app -> server -> test -> tooling as separate processes and stops at the
// first failure. The build is mtime-based (tsc -b); if a result looks stale, `rm -rf ../.tsbuild`.
